  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekretariatet f&#xf6;r Multilateral Initiative on Malaria (MIM) ligger i Dar es Salaam, Tanzania och fungerar som en koordinat&#xf6;r av malariaforskning i Afrika. De organiserar ocks&#xe5; v&#xe4;rldens st&#xf6;rsta konferens om malaria.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The secretariat for Multilateral Initiative on Malaria (MIM) is in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania and functions as a coordinator of malaria research in Africa. They also organizes the largest conference in the world on malaria research.</narrative>
